WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:06.910
Overall, Ireland could benefit more from the EU by making use of available funding, supporting

00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:13.730
businesses and investing in research and renewable energy, and increasing educational opportunities.

00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:18.190
By working with other EU countries, Ireland can make the most of the opportunities that

00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:19.870
EU membership provides.
